a game running on iPhone in landscape. A name appears within a shaded lozenge shape above each of 3 plants and a status message appears in a rounded rectangle in the top-right corner. All text uses a size that's at least the recommended minimum.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4c38de72c94767cbb6bd7763720ef281/game-typography-correct%402x.png","line":29,"embedded":true},{"title":"Conveying hierarchy","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/typography#Conveying-hierarchy","line":35},{"title":"Using system fonts","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/typography#Using-system-fonts","line":43},{"title":"The phrase 'The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.' shown in the San Francisco Pro font.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e270b0f4e91f523bb7372a39447ad4e4/typography-sanfrancisco%402x.png","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"The phrase 'The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.' shown in the New York font.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8dcb4d6f97b97a957a0d73e4ee85730c/typography-new-york%402x.png","line":55,"embedded":true},{"title":"here","target":"https://developer.apple.com/fonts/","line":57},{"title":"The word 'text' shown in the SF Pro font, repeated in two rows of nine columns each. The rows show upright and italic styles, and the columns show font weights ranging from ultralight to black.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8b07ec795d9ad16c787edb0030018a09/font-weight-sf-pro%402x.png","line":67,"embedded":true},{"title":"SF Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sf-symbols","line":71},{"title":"Supporting Dynamic Type","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/typography#Supporting-Dynamic-Type","line":75},{"title":"`leading(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/Font/leading\\(_:\\